          "title": "Applying Daltons Theory to Compound Formation",
          "problemStatement": "Explain how Daltons theory accounts for the Law of Definite Proportions.",
          "stepByStepSolution": [
            "Step 1: Daltons postulate states that compounds are formed when atoms of different elements combine in fixed whole-number ratios.",
            "Step 2: Since each element has a fixed characteristic atomic mass, a fixed whole-number ratio of atoms results in a fixed mass ratio."
